2a:["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-8","children":[["$","section","What term insurance actually is",{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-tight","children":"What term insurance actually is"}],[["$","p","Term insurance pays a lump sum to your n",{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"Term insurance pays a lump sum to your nominees if you die during the policy term. There is usually no maturity “return of premium” story unless you buy a costly variant. You are buying income replacement for dependants — not a savings product."}],["$","p","Endowment / traditional “money-back” pla",{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"Endowment / traditional “money-back” plans mix insurance with savings and often deliver weaker cover for the same premium. Beginners who need protection first usually start with pure term, then invest surplus separately (SIP, PPF, FD). This is educational, not a recommendation to buy or cancel any product."}]],null,null,["$","div",null,{"className":"container flex justify-center py-4 !px-0","data-cv-ad-zone":"hub-editorial","children":["$","aside",null,{"aria-label":"Advertisement","data-cv-ad-zone":"mrec","className":"mx-auto flex w-fit max-w-full flex-col items-center","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-1.5 text-center text-[9px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted-foreground/70","children":"Ad"}],["$","$L32",null,{"slotKey":"hub","width":300,"height":250}]]}]}]]}],["$","section","A simple cover estimate (not a formula you must follow)",{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-tight","children":"A simple cover estimate (not a formula you must follow)"}],[["$","p","A common starting conversation is 10–15×",{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"A common starting conversation is 10–15× annual take-home income, then adjust for outstanding home loans, young children, and existing EPF/gratuity. Someone with a large home loan and one income in the house often needs more cover than a dual-income household with no debt."}],["$","p","Run your salary numbers on our salary-ta",{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"Run your salary numbers on our salary-tax calculator so you know real take-home, not CTC. Do not buy cover based on a WhatsApp “₹1 crore for ₹500” ad without reading the prospectus."}]],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground","children":[["$","li","List dependants and years of support they may need",{"children":"List dependants and years of support they may need"}],["$","li","Subtract liquid assets you would already leave them",{"children":"Subtract liquid assets you would already leave them"}],["$","li","Add large liabilities (home loan balance) you do not want them to inherit as stress",{"children":"Add large liabilities (home loan balance) you do not want them to inherit as stress"}]]}],null,null]}],["$","section","Premium, age, and health — why waiting is expensive",{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-tight","children":"Premium, age, and health — why waiting is expensive"}],[["$","p","Premiums rise with age and with health d",{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"Premiums rise with age and with health disclosures (smoking, BMI, existing conditions). Buying later is not “the same plan cheaper” — underwriting can load or reject. Online journeys still end in medicals for many tickets."}],"$L33"],null,null,null]}],"$L34","$L35"]}]
