34:["$","section","Claim basics families should know",{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-tight","children":"Claim basics families should know"}],[["$","p","Keep the policy PDF, premium receipts, a",{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"Keep the policy PDF, premium receipts, and nominee details where your family can find them. Typical claim packs include death certificate, KYC, bank details, and medical records if required. Contested claims often involve non-disclosure of health history — answer the proposal form honestly."}]],null,null,null]}]
